zirbe (0.11.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * A video attachment shows its first frame under its message, and plays in the default player when clicked
  * A voice or video message received without text is transcribed on this computer, shown in its bubble and found by search
  * Record and send a voice message from the reply box, with a transcript when whisper.cpp is installed
  * Pick recipients from a searchable list of contacts when starting a conversation
  * Filter the list to conversations with voice or video, and mark their rows
  * Hovering over a message shows the day and time it was sent
  * A picture you send shows in its bubble at once, before the Sent folder has its copy
  * Play a voice message or other audio attachment in its bubble
  * A reply that folds away quoted text shows a Show quoted text link under it
  * Show a picture sent between lines of text, the way phones send one, as an attachment

